+# BLUE CURRENT V48.25.0 — EXPANSION READINESS & ROLLOUT SCOPE
+
+V48.21–V48.25 converts a signed human EXPAND decision into a controlled rollout draft.
+
+## Added
+- signed expansion decision prerequisite
+- signed rollout scope preservation
+- per-location operating evidence in rollout view
+- rollout owner
+- locations-per-wave control
+- cadence in days
+- readiness floor
+- rollout conditions
+- deterministic wave assignment
+- rollout-plan history
+- audit + realtime event
+
+## Critical boundary
+A rollout plan is planning data only.
+
+- `draftDoesNotActivate: true`
+- `automaticActivation: false`
+- `automaticExpansion: false`
+- `humanActivationRequired: true`
+
+Every planned location is created with:
+- state: `PLANNED`
+- activationApproved: `false`
+- activationApprovedBy: `null`
+- activationApprovedAt: `null`
+
+Drafting is admin-only.
+
+## Current authenticated integration result
+Current isolated Chefs runtime:
+- expansion authorization: absent
+- rollout scope: 0
+- status: `expansion-not-authorized`
+- non-admin draft attempt: blocked
+- automatic activation: false
+
+That is the expected state until a qualified administrator records a signed human EXPAND decision.
